{"pageid": 749, "title": "Sara Washington", "revid": 1924, "categories": ["Characters", "Humans", "Children", "Deceased", "Archer's Peak", "Unseen characters", "Characters (SIKTC comics)"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Sara Washington</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/3/34/CarlyMonitzSleepover.png/revision/latest?cb=20241215172924\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"CarlyMonitzSleepover\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/3/34/CarlyMonitzSleepover.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241215172924\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/3/34/CarlyMonitzSleepover.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241215172924 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/3/34/CarlyMonitzSleepover.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20241215172924 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"CarlyMonitzSleepover\" width=\"270\" height=\"402\" data-image-key=\"CarlyMonitzSleepover.png\" data-image-name=\"CarlyMonitzSleepover.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Biographical Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Deceased\" title=\"Category:Deceased\">Deceased</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occupation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Occupation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Student</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"cause_of_death\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Cause of Death</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Killed by the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype mother (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfbW90aGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Archer's Peak Oscuratype mother</span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Relationships</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatives\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Relatives</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unnamed uncle</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"first_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">First Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_3\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 3\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #3</a> <small>(mentioned)</small></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"last_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_12\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 12\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #12</a> <small>(mentioned)</small></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Sara Washington</b> was a young girl living in <a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak, Wisconsin</a> in 2020. She was the first victim of the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype Monster (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfTW9uc3Rlcj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Oscuratype Monster</span> in the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak incident (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX2luY2lkZW50P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Archer's Peak incident</span>.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>Sara Washington had a criminal or suspicious uncle, who would later be blamed for her disappearance until it was shown there was no sign of her in his home.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC3&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC3-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Sara was told the story about <a href=\"/wiki/James\" title=\"James\">James</a> seeing a <a href=\"/wiki/Monster\" title=\"Monster\">monster</a> under the ravine; as she's noted to be one of <a href=\"/wiki/Carly_Monitz\" title=\"Carly Monitz\">Carly Monitz</a>'s friends, it's probable she was one of the first to hear the story as <a href=\"/wiki/Tyler_Monitz\" title=\"Tyler Monitz\">Tyler Monitz</a> told it. She and the other girls spread around school the tale in order to discourage kids from going into the woods.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC12&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC12-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>A month and a half before <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a>'s arrival in Archer's Peak,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC3&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC3-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Sara went missing about a half-mile from Lake Michigan.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC4&#95;3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC4-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> It was later determined that she was the first victim of the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype mother (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfbW90aGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Archer's Peak Oscuratype mother</span>, which manifested due to the collective fear of the children.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC12&#95;2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC12-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Eventually, her death would be blamed on <a href=\"/wiki/Tommy_Mahoney\" title=\"Tommy Mahoney\">Tommy Mahoney</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC15&#95;4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC15-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_3\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 3\">Issue #3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_4\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 4\">Issue #4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_12\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 12\">Issue #12</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<small><div style=\"width:auto; max-height:190px; overflow:auto; padding-left:0.5em; padding-right:0.5em; border-top-left-radius:0.5em; border-bottom-left-radius:0.5em\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SIKTC3-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC3_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC3_1-1\">1.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">Tynion, James IV</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something is Killing the Children</a>,</i> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Angel_of_Archer%27s_Peak_(comic_arc)\" title=\"The Angel of Archer&#39;s Peak (comic arc)\">vol. #1</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_3\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 3\">issue no. 3</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>, 2019.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SIKTC12-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC12_2-0\">2.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC12_2-1\">2.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">Tynion, James IV</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something is Killing the Children</a>,</i> <a href=\"/wiki/A_Game_of_Nowhere_(comic_arc)\" title=\"A Game of Nowhere (comic arc)\">vol. #3</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_12\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 12\">issue no. 12</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>, 2020.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SIKTC4-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC4_3-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">Tynion, James IV</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something is Killing the Children</a>,</i> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Angel_of_Archer%27s_Peak_(comic_arc)\" title=\"The Angel of Archer&#39;s Peak (comic arc)\">vol. #1</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_4\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 4\">issue no. 4</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>, 2019.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SIKTC15-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC15_4-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">Tynion, James IV</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something is Killing the Children</a>,</i> <a href=\"/wiki/A_Game_of_Nowhere_(comic_arc)\" title=\"A Game of Nowhere (comic arc)\">vol. #3</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_15\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 15\">issue no. 15</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>, 2021.</span>\n</li>\n</o